  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "23B358EDDFA19B4F",
      "text": "嘿！吃飽了沒啊！\\n歡迎來到玻瓶道館！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "23B359EDDFA19D02",
      "text": "咦？呃啊～！？\\n怎麼原來是[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳啊！\\r\\n我以為是別的客人咧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "8C63E93F1A5A5906",
      "text": "首席冠軍？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "8C63E83F1A5A5753",
      "text": "我是代替她來的",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "23B35AEDDFA19EB5",
      "text": "哦！這樣啊，這樣啊！\\n是也慈姑娘安排的是吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "23B353EDDFA192D0",
      "text": "想想[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳不久之前還在\\n收集徽章呢。\\r\\n竟然轉眼就晉升冠軍級啦！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "23B354EDDFA19483",
      "text": "簡直就是躍龍門寶可夢！\\n活蹦亂跳地進化後，就是大豐收啊！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "23B355EDDFA19636",
      "text": "想不到[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳這個最有成就的新人\\n會親自來鑑定我的實力！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 3,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "23B356EDDFA197E9",
      "text": "不過我可是經營餐廳的，\\n被人評價可是家常便飯，習慣啦。[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "23B35FEDDFA1A734",
      "text": "來，這就來和我大打一場，\\n看我夠不夠格當個道館館主吧？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_retry",
      "hash64": "40E90C6A0916AEC6",
      "text": "嘿！吃飽了沒啊！\\n如何？要和我打一場了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "23B360EDDFA1A8E7",
      "text": "好！\\n跟著大叔我來吧！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_010_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "23B65DEDDFA3D9A5",
      "text": "食材和對戰的關鍵都是鮮度！\\n趁著鮮嫩可口，趕緊回來啊～！[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
